DESCRIPTION:Gay Christmas is around the corner! Drop by Halloween on Churc
 h on October 30 and 31 to regale in spooky festivities. Bring your friends
 . Bring your best costume. Bring your party spirit! Whether you&#x27\;re o
 ut for a quick haunt or celebrating until the witching hour\, stop by our 
 Community Care Tent on October 31 from 5 to 10 p.m. for free treats\, reso
 urces\, and support: - Candy and hot beverages - Sexual health resources\,
  safer sex supplies\, and masks - Harm reduction supplies: crystal\, stem\
 , foil\, short\, long kits - Drug testing kits: benzos\, fentanyl - Naloxo
 ne kits: distribution and on-the-spot education - Safety planning and safe
 r partying education Community care doesn’t need to be a nightmare on Ch
 urch Street. We&#x27\;re here to help make your Halloween a little safer a
 nd a lot more fun. Come find us outside The 519 building on Church Street.
  [Image description: Three people posing in spooky outfits. Text below rea
 ds: Queer-o-Ween Care! Drop by The 519 community care tent on Halloween on
  Church for harm reduction supplies and warm drinks. Saturday\, October 31
 \, 5 to 10 pm\, On Church St.\, free\, drop-in] ‍
LOCATION:The 519 Community Centre\, 519 Church Street
