DESCRIPTION:Test your Buffyverse trivia and watch drag that slays! Come so
 lo or in a team. It’s a BUFFY THE VAMPIRE SLAYER TRIVIA NIGHT with DRAG!
  Featuring Lucy Flawless and Coyote Ugly *** TICKETS INCLUDE ONE FREE DRIN
 K! *** This is a licensed event\, with cheap drinks (nothing over $6.50 be
 fore tax and tip) BRING A TEAM and test your wits against other scooby gan
 gs. or COME ALONE or in pairs and be matched up with friendly strangers on
  teams. 7pm - Doors 7:30pm - Drag! 7:45pm - First Round of Trivia! 8:30pm 
 - Break! 8:45pm - More Drag! 9pm - Second Round of Trivia! 9:30pm - Big Sc
 reen Viewing of HUSH (Free) 10:30pm - End TRIVIA - How it works You can ei
 ther sign up as a COVEN or as SLAYER. A COVEN is just a fun way to say tea
 m. You bring your own COVEN\, up to 6 people. A SLAYER is just a fun way t
 o say you want us to put you in a group. SLAYERS will be put into teams of
  4-6 with people they don’t know. It’s a great way to make friends!(no
 te: if like 2 or 3 people want to play together but also want to meet new 
 people\, sign up as SLAYERS and we will keep you together and add new peop
 le to your mix) There are two rounds of Trivia. COVENS stay on the same te
 am for the whole night. SLAYERS change teams and are in a new team for rou
 nd 2. There will be cheesy prizes for the winning team of each round. DRAG
  - How it works It&#x27\;s Toronto&#x27\;s most famous Buffy impersonator:
  Lucy Flawless And the guy who will get your blood pumping : Coyote Ugly B
 ring your 5s and 10s to tip your drag artists and show them some love. HUS
 H - How it works At 9:30pm we are going to open to the public and screen 
 “Hush” on a BIG 150 inch screen (yes - that is 7 feet high and 9 feet 
 wide!). So invite your friends who couldn’t make trivia to come watch th
 e episode for free! TICKETS! Tickets are $16 per person and YOU GET A FREE
  DRINK WITH YOUR TICKET! (alcoholic or sober). DRINKS AND FOOD We will be 
 serving alcohol and sober drinks at this event. We will also have packaged
  snacks (chips\, cookies\, etc) for you to munch on. You can bring in any 
 food you want\, but not other drinks. And as a bonus: Everyone gets one fr
 ee drink with your ticket purchase! ‍
