BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:&quot\;How Queer Are You?&quot\; Presented by Mimi Osa
DTSTART:20261111T190000
DTEND:20261111T190000
UID:0bd75f5c6adbdfceb7407f45f497c7b9@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Mimi Osa tries to determine the exact qualities that make some
 one queer &quot\;enough&quot\;...through the power of comedy! You know wha
 t they say\, third time&#x27\;s the...charm (which also happens to be the 
 phrase on the spine of the physical version of Clairo&#x27\;s third and be
 st studio album)! We&#x27\;re bringing you an all-drag queen edition of &q
 uot\;How Queer Are You?&quot\; Not for lack of trying - Toronto comedians 
 are just surprisingly bad at answering their message requests! Self-procla
 imed &quot\;woman of the hour\, lady of the night&quot\; Mimi Osa continue
 s her journey to define queerness in the modern age by asking performers t
 o expose and explain their identity on the only place it matters [to her] 
 - the stage! Join Mimi and &quot\;friends&quot\; for a night of fun and fr
 ivolity guaranteed to make you ask yourself &quot\;how did I get here?&quo
 t\; and &quot\;can I get a refund?&quot\; There&#x27\;ll be comedy\, lipsy
 ncing\, silly little games\, and potential for a healing of the heart! It&
 #x27\;s a Wednesday so who knows!? Hilarity ensues November 11th at Hail M
 ary on College Street! Mimi Osa has been performing in drag for over a dec
 ade and has little to show for it. She won the August edition of Star Seac
 h at Crews &amp\; Tangos and hasn&#x27\;t done much of anything else since
 . She keeps saying she&#x27\;s working on a one-woman show (which has a ti
 tle!) but sources close to the rising star deny that anything worthwhile h
 as materialized. Hunni Krüller is the twisted sister of Comedian Tom Hear
 n. Hunni has blurred the lines of Comedy and drag. Hunni is known for her 
 HIGH ENERGY hosting and live vocals. She placed 6th in Crews and Tangos Ne
 xt Drag Superstar\, was featured on the hit CBS show Skymed and been featu
 red in JFL Toronto. Hunni is the producer of the all drag comedy tour Werq
  the Mic and creator and host of Lipsynced. Milkshook is a Toronto based d
 rag artist\, brunch enthusiast\, and current reigning Witch of the West - 
 despite living in the East end. Her performances focus on pop culture\, cu
 rrent box office hits (and misses)\, titty reveals\, and flat wigs with ba
 ngs. Pam is Toronto&#x27\;s largest glamp queen! After finally freeing her
 self from the curse that made her protect a bridge\, she&#x27\;s been ente
 rtaining audiences all across Ontario. SEX MAGAZINE is a Hollywood dame kn
 own for her classic beauty. As a sensetive child who&#x27\;s grown into a.
 ..sensitive adult they are inspired by the vulnerable and messy artists wh
 o yearn to sell it...like Liza Minelli. Doors open at 7pm\, Show starts at
  8pm. *If you&#x27\;re a queer identified comic or performer of any kind a
 nd would like to see yourself represented on a future lineup\, send Mimi a
  DM on Instagram: @mimiosaqueen. She&#x27\;s always looking for fresh tale
 nt to exploit! ‍
