 irst EP in 1987\; Living in the land was released on an old classic Chicag
 o House music label TRAXX! Gene has released on labels such as\, Djax\, Hy
 brid\, Mc Projects\, Step 2 House\, Svek and Rush hour where he made is ma
 rk abroad. We are honoured to have Mr.Gene Hunt back at Shango! As they sa
 y the third time is the charm?! You DO NOT want to miss this legend! Zeina
  - Warm\, open\, and grounded\, Cairo-based DJ/ Producer\, Zeina crafts an
 d curates music that is as expressive and creative as she is. Zeina has sp
 ent the past 15 years between North America\, Europe and Egypt exploring t
 he vast space where house and techno meet. In these intersections of cultu
 res &amp\; forms\, Zeina’s selection takes flight! Kiki LeFreak is a Can
 adian\, Toronto artist\, DJ\, Producer and a community builder of freaks\,
  geeks\, queers\, dancers and heads. Best known for high energy DJ sets an
 d her underground party Shango\, that has gained a cult like following . P
 erforming downstairs in The Jama curated by NEU! WhodafunkisGreg - South o
 f France raised and Toronto-based\, the founder of NEU delivers infectious
  grooves\, disco-infused house\, and high-energy beats with a distinct\, f
 unky flavor. Brock Stacey is Toronto-based creative\, floral artist\, and 
 DJ\, Brock Stacey delivers deep\, immersive rhythms and refined energy gua
 ranteed to keep the dance floor locked in from start to finish. Shango is 
 for the freaks\, geeks\, queers\, dancers and heads! PLUR in effect\, anyo
 ne acting inappropriately will be removed from the party. 1point4hertz and
  The Jama 961 College st ‍
